  ('ECO 101', 'Principles of Economics I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Social Sciences', 'Geography', '100 Level', 'first', 2, 'Nature and significance of Economics; The methodology of economics; Economic tools of analysis; Theories of demand and supply; Elementary analysis; Dynamic theory of price; Elements of price theory; Production theory: Output, cost, law of diminishing returns; Market structure: Perfect competition, monopoly, oligopoly etc; Elementary theory of welfare economics; Determinants for and pricing of productive factors; Interest rate and profit.', '["Nature and significance of Economics", "The methodology of economics", "Economic tools of analysis", "Theories of demand and supply", "Elementary analysis", "Dynamic theory of price", "Elements of price theory", "Production theory: Output, cost, law of diminishing returns", "Market structure: Perfect competition, monopoly, oligopoly etc", "Elementary theory of welfare economics", "Determinants for and pricing of productive factors", "Interest rate and profit"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Economics handbook'),
