  ('PSC 101', 'Introduction to Political Science I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Social Sciences', 'Geography', '100 Level', 'first', 2, 'The course introduces students to the nature of politics and how it is played; it emphasizes the issues of political discourse and practice; it also introduces students to the language and basic concepts of political science and other disciplines.', '["The course introduces students to the nature of politics and how it is played", "It emphasizes the issues of political discourse and practice", "It also introduces students to the language and basic concepts of political science and other disciplines"]'::jsonb, 'Department of Political Science handbook'),
